0">happiness </span><span begin="01:01.500" end="01:02.040">isn't </span><span begin="01:02.040" end="01:05.490">far</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.820" end="01:12.990"><span begin="01:05.820" end="01:07.350">Far</span><span begin="01:07.350" end="01:07.620">, </span><span begin="01:07.620" end="01:08.010">not </span><span begin="01:08.010" end="01:08.370">far </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.730">from </span><span begin="01:08.730" end="01:09.420">where </span><span begin="01:09.420" end="01:09.810">you </span><span begin="01:09.810" end="01:12.990">are</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.990" end="01:28.500"><span begin="01:12.990" end="01:17.520">Watching </span><span begin="01:17.520" end="01:17.580">the </span><span begin="01:17.580" end="01:28.500">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.890" end="01:43.950"><span begin="01:40.890" end="01:41.310">Turn </span><span begin="01:41.310" end="01:42.060">around</span><span begin="01:42.060" end="01:42.780">, </span><span begin="01:42.780" end="01:42.930">I'm </span><span begin="01:42.930" end="01:43.140">right </span><span begin="01:43.140" end="01:43.590">behind </span><span begin="01:43.590" end="01:43.950">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.960" end="01:48.510"><span begin="01:45.960" end="01:46.350">Turn </span><span begin="01:46.350" end="01:46.590">around</span><span begin="01:46.590" end="01:46.890">, </span><span begin="01:46.890" end="01:47.040">I'll </span><span begin="01:47.040" end="01:47.430">turn </span><span begin="01:47.430" end="01:48.240">around </span><span begin="01:48.240" end="01:48.510">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.510" end="01:50.760"><span begin="01:48.510" end="01:48.791">Turn </span><span begin="01:48.791" end="01:49.072">around</span><span begin="01:49.072" end="01:49.353">, </span><span begin="01:49.353" end="01:49.634">so </span><span begin="01:49.634" end="01:49.915">we </span><span begin="01:49.915" end="01:50.196">can </span><spa